oughton County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/michigan/houghton-county"],["ARC or PLC in Houghton County","/arc-plc/michigan/houghton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February and February to March each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those 75 years. In 2026 so far, April to May sat at 66% of normal on the middle of the grids and May to June at 84%. Grid 31665 had its driest year in 1976, at 61% of normal.</p>"}
